#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:5 3cfdf5b90f8e44a6aac1e9cd50a76d93
#: 5d7d32e33b4a4e21bda4cd5eea94a439 a3c9d1d957344ecc9e104ac9005d1ded
#: c9d29eda39ec4af99aacd1a0c376da67
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr "按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:7 323be55452404068abb4ecc59ff5f3bd
#: 50a92ca6b7b64e1f84af96baf44b477a 6c50d77798624d15a553cca451bbba6c
#: e8c0ee9aecea40f686c483b3ec696536
msgid ""
"Up to four external buttons or switches connected to the autopilot can be "
"configured to trigger :ref:`Auxiliary Functions <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` similar to how RC channel switches can trigger them. These "
"button inputs can be configured to use either digital logic level voltage "
"inputs (pull-to-ground or pull-to-high) or PWM signal inputs."
msgstr ""
"最多可将四个连接至飞控的外部按钮或开关配置为触发 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`，类似于RC通道开关触发这些功能的方式。这些按钮输入可配置为数字逻辑电平电压输入（拉低或拉高）或PWM信号输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:11 10accc57ce244bf1a7d5a9f046ebca2a
#: 6abf806b6dbd447f9646cc3a87867df3 90974feeebb34417849e9e2f34d48fc1
#: ddb89df7c09743afa513cd670853cfc4
msgid ""
"Some :ref:`auxiliary function <common-auxiliary-functions>` have a middle "
"position (e.g \"Parachute 3 Pos Switch\") but the middle position cannot be "
"triggered from a button"
msgstr ""
"部分 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-functions>` "
"具有中间位置（如「三段开关降落伞」），但中间位置无法通过按钮触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:14 0e349b26bb7547d28e83b98c1ad07893
#: 1df2ce2b94a34a31b2a1a06626997690 8e73bd35d2ed4ffbb4cec31411628b35
#: 94aa755d11f440f099101fc2ddc8a1e3
msgid "Basic Setup"
msgstr "基本设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:16 3974de348b9847cb83f1362962353abf
#: ad1969918f864bf49a663debdb9ce729 bd32722bf7514b88859e0c354407a6e5
#: f1085cc3d00143fc9088ea1337f232dc
msgid ""
"In order to use a button, an autopilot pin must be configured as a GPIO. "
"Many autopilots have dedicated pins for this, but some do not. In those "
"cases, a normal SERVO/MOTOR output must be configured as a GPIO pin instead "
"of an :ref:`common-rcoutput-mapping`."
msgstr ""
"要使用按钮，飞控引脚必须配置为GPIO。许多飞控有专用引脚，但部分没有。在没有专用引脚的情况下，必须将普通的SERVO/MOTOR输出配置为GPIO引脚，而非"
" :ref:`common-rcoutput-mapping`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:18 085d57e449774e15b26fa321c9b69b34
#: 1c855887858449e28777580d2089c20a 1da986bf04ae405383c03aa1ccb3f792
#: df7df08aefc74f0899d446879071b814
msgid ""
"For autopilots with an IOMCU (e.g. Pixhawk, CubeOrange) the external button "
"or switch should be connected to the autopilot's AUX outputs (not the MAIN "
"outputs).  To ease configuration and avoid timer conflicts it may be best to"
" use AUX outputs at the high end (e.g. AUX5 or AUX6) far from outputs used "
"for motors and servos.  For autopilots without an IOMCU (e.g. pixracer, etc)"
" the normal SERVO/MOTOR outputs may be used."
msgstr ""
"对于带IOMCU的飞控（如Pixhawk、CubeOrange），外部按钮或开关应连接至飞控的AUX输出（而非MAIN输出）。为便于配置并避免定时器冲突，最好使用编号较高的AUX输出（如AUX5或AUX6），远离电机和舵机使用的输出。对于无IOMCU的飞控（如Pixracer等），可使用普通的SERVO/MOTOR输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:20 811640a77e344e7c897d38b5737ccedc
#: b20cc92bfa04449788eae326fc743bab c1dba1f001a945b1bcfd2ca08af397f7
#: d8245aa8a4b945e1a0d2170842a49cda
msgid "Set :ref:`BTN_ENABLE<BTN_ENABLE>` = 1 (Enable) and refresh parameters"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BTN_ENABLE<BTN_ENABLE>` = 1（启用）并刷新参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:21 1b07af6d37c94d22b161ad873de93f86
#: 41b7d226b73a46b482a070fcb6953afc ab7add774f77406bb947808b31a6e4e1
#: d13eb478e6634eac907e7332e187ee58
msgid ""
"Set the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = -1 (GPIO) where \"x\" is the servo output "
"channel connected to the button . For example, if the AUX6 output on an "
"autopilot with an IOMCU is to be used as a GPIO, set "
":ref:`SERVO14_FUNCTION<SERVO14_FUNCTION>` = -1."
msgstr ""
"将连接按钮的舵机输出通道 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` = "
"-1（GPIO），其中「x」为连接按钮的舵机输出通道。例如，若要将带IOMCU飞控的AUX6输出用作GPIO，则设置 "
":ref:`SERVO14_FUNCTION<SERVO14_FUNCTION>` = -1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:24 4b1c13bf87fc45ab9881c9cc3a5682c6
#: 56dd8f9c3424481cab83a0336d3fd9bd cab14735847e45e6a25ab779baa8af12
#: f3c00a8c97c24835a2557dd64729a5f0
msgid "Digital Logic/Analog Voltage Setup"
msgstr "数字逻辑/模拟电压设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:26 0b615171aedf410e8f7a43aca85485f5
#: 4c1382c80ee54549bcb354d9f5d4d3dc 50a9a92223de43069f6d037eb892e559
#: bf9d489f7fc34721b42d3f09b5963a09
msgid ""
"Digital logic level analog voltages can be used for the button input.  The "
"parameter changes listed below are for the 1st button but the 2nd, 3rd and "
"4th buttons can be setup similarly, simply replace the \"1\" in the "
"parameter names with \"2\", \"3\" or \"4\". In order to determine which GPIO"
" pin number corresponds to which autopilot SERVO/MOTOR output pin or "
"dedicated GPIO pin, the autopilot's hwdef.dat file must be consulted. See "
":ref:`common-gpios` for how to determine this."
msgstr ""
"数字逻辑电平模拟电压可用于按钮输入。以下参数更改适用于第1个按钮，第2、3、4个按钮可类似设置，只需将参数名中的「1」替换为「2」、「3」或「4」。要确定哪个GPIO引脚编号对应飞控的哪个SERVO/MOTOR输出引脚或专用GPIO引脚，需要查阅飞控的hwdef.dat文件。如何确定请参阅"
" :ref:`common-gpios`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:28
#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:43 1e588e9957eb444baeb6c4cc91d088c5
#: 64a5a19dab304429a923a8d872cb785a 64f094f65f9d400fa88db62b1a5f2398
#: 78d84551f1cb4cb5aa524e09d1c6459c a090cdcf2ad84e3483753fd63be985b6
#: c0ed07c4eced49b7a4424dba8fd33a21 cd3c96e98639480395303149e0a11a3b
#: e5987cf4ae3f4f43b900a9549a76a4d4
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BTN_PIN1<BTN_PIN1>` to the number of the GPIO connected to the "
"button/switch (e.g. \"55\" = \"AUXOUT6\")"
msgstr "将 :ref:`BTN_PIN1<BTN_PIN1>` 设置为连接按钮/开关的GPIO编号（如 「55」 = 「AUXOUT6」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:29 7e184b4cfefb4e168a319e4de3bf83eb
#: 87cb271ad313400b9753938bc96b039c a5c6a27c11014120b808ed135356eed4
#: ed309bdddf1e40fcbd4c6814a0595fb3
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BTN_OPTIONS1<BTN_OPTIONS1>` = set to zero (no bits set in bitmask)"
" to trigger on high logic level voltage (>2.4V) and  be interpreted as a "
"\"HIGH\" position by the Auxiliary function. Setting bit 1 (PWM input) "
"detects PWM above or below 1800/1200us instead of logic level. If PWM is not"
" detected or is less than 800us or above 2200us the button will interpreted "
"as low. Setting bit 2 (Invert) changes HIGH state to be logic low voltage on"
" pin, or below 1200us, if PWM input."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BTN_OPTIONS1<BTN_OPTIONS1>` "
"设置为零（位掩码中无位置位），在逻辑高电平（>2.4V）时触发，并被辅助功能解释为「HIGH」位置。设置第1位（PWM输入）可改为检测1800/1200us以上/以下的PWM而非逻辑电平；若未检测到PWM，或PWM小于800us或大于2200us，则按钮被解释为低电平。设置第2位（反相）可将HIGH状态改为引脚逻辑低电平，若为PWM输入则为1200us以下。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:30
#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:46 430865b88bb248ae88bc1f9b3ddcdcd2
#: 47c5fa7e7d04437fa3efc5c0687e416a 5a59c79aa9fb4538b0d9f06072e3d970
#: 5b851d8d017e4c14a268a99f05e25b9d 692e46972d164eda826c6eb4c9070c8e
#: a6726565f0584b189ded91d18d369eb9 c45817eec3f14feeb431cfff2daf05fa
#: d52feccdde304383917d58fc308c2928
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BTN_FUNC1<BTN_FUNC1>` to the :ref:`Auxiliary Function <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>` to be triggered.  If set to 0, no function is to be "
"triggered."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BTN_FUNC1<BTN_FUNC1>` 设置为要触发的 :ref:`辅助功能 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>`。若设置为0，则不触发任何功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:32 069a5d8cf4694c858a107737ba81a2ff
#: 1f54b8fd57bf4604887bd50bd963432b a27c3428d8e54fa398a75d013dc3eaec
#: c0bd0f76e37740ae81d3aa9fe1dbbf2d
msgid ""
"The pin is automatically configured with an internal pullup meaning the "
"button or switch is only required to pull the voltage low."
msgstr "引脚已自动配置为内部上拉，因此按钮或开关只需将电压拉低即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:36 25c86feefa674673a4e33a682305aeff
#: 449fc08824b7403ca5f48801a810a446 c19346c4c7574ad6a6f6e337e3d69821
#: f2088657f4724122afb4ceb5a2e749ee
msgid ""
"Some autopilots pull pins high or low during startup and this may lead to "
"the auxiliary function triggering soon after startup"
msgstr "某些飞控在启动时会将引脚拉高或拉低，这可能导致辅助功能在启动后不久被触发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:39 5dafe569679b4e36a24a9dcb05ebe73f
#: 6c953703d70d49df93888cc311a19407 95c2fe892bf14ac087875d80dbbbf82c
#: a15279d9aebc4dabbbe10bbbc87fdcaa
msgid "PWM Input Setup"
msgstr "PWM输入设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:41 26f8b63eee2346ddb43a4cd889c8dae9
#: 6cc9c5268e654ac7b8bddddcff2ca5dd 8619cf704a7d4454ae1432c5154f93c6
#: f4c38f9abd3d40f3af9e2d212813ff95
msgid ""
"PWM signals can be used as button inputs.  PWM values >1800us or <1200us can"
" be used to trigger the Auxiliary Function. The parameter changes listed "
"below are for the 1st button, but the 2nd, 3rd and 4th buttons can be setup "
"similarly. As above, to determine which GPIO pin number corresponds to which"
" autopilot SERVO/MOTOR output pin or dedicated GPIO pin, the autopilot's "
"hwdef.dat file must be consulted. See :ref:`common-gpios` for how to "
"determine this."
msgstr ""
"PWM信号可用作按钮输入。PWM值>1800us或<1200us可用于触发辅助功能。以下参数更改适用于第1个按钮，第2、3、4个按钮可类似设置。与上文相同，要确定GPIO引脚编号对应飞控的哪个SERVO/MOTOR输出引脚或专用GPIO引脚，需要查阅飞控的hwdef.dat文件。如何确定请参阅"
" :ref:`common-gpios`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:44 8b48659a52474ec98d391354226b0416
#: bb5b3da3505f4ad0916e6bbafde009ff c3f1e5edbc244a76b1c1052bd66e6630
#: ddbdf44f12e1440bbb3d0f263d3c1703
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BTN_OPTIONS1<BTN_OPTIONS1>` = to \"1\" to be interpreted as a "
"\"HIGH\" position by the auxiliary function with a PWM > 1800us"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BTN_OPTIONS1<BTN_OPTIONS1>` 设置为 「1」，PWM > 1800us时被辅助功能解释为「HIGH」位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:45 3bfed79191a24ae995c9dbfb93e93057
#: 616e4e69b7824ca88d4cbd823c5ca842 6bde4bb9be1e41118ad406e52aaac4bf
#: 950a1a89a96a4b0fb329dc0693ff770a
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BTN_OPTIONS1<BTN_OPTIONS1>` = to \"3\" to be interpreted as a "
"\"HIGH\" position by the auxiliary function with a PWM < 1200us, or missing "
"a signal input. PWM >1800us will be interpreted as the \"LOW\" position."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BTN_OPTIONS1<BTN_OPTIONS1>` 设置为 「3」，PWM < "
"1200us或信号缺失时被辅助功能解释为「HIGH」位置。PWM > 1800us将被解释为「LOW」位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:50 09130657818b45178e3dcfdb0c6d125c
#: 7c9cae84c8234dc787378743b95881a2 c8d8dd59756a4e148a1778a7da96008f
#: ca73c1a6823345c29181d9bdf9447b05
msgid ""
"The valid PWM input range is 800us to 2200us.  If the PWM value falls "
"outside this range, or is missing, it is equivalent applying <1200us.  "
"Normally this means the auxiliary function will not be triggered unless the "
"invert option of ``BTN_OPTIONSx`` is set."
msgstr ""
"有效PWM输入范围为800us至2200us。若PWM值超出此范围或信号缺失，等同于施加<1200us。通常这意味着辅助功能不会被触发，除非设置了 "
"``BTN_OPTIONSx`` 的反相选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:53 2c79da3001d74de394e6f4d8b87adcb1
#: 38710ffe2b3b47d2861e36a92550d1d0 5d07ce3f92074bc3bd5aecb3ab03dcf4
#: c126001cf3554dcf883f5492d548aa1d
msgid "Additional Setup"
msgstr "附加设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-buttons.rst:55 4eec9a75ea04400ba4cb153592fab021
#: a03ed7656af849f7a5f8398f69a4524b b692ea7b969c4c97a41db5482d7bf985
#: c7a9991a8e8842d9950fe09fc6afa0b8
msgid ""
":ref:`BTN_REPORT_SEND<BTN_REPORT_SEND>` sets the length of time that a "
"`BUTTON_CHANGE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#BUTTON_CHANGE>`__"
" mavlink2 message is sent to the ground control station each time the button"
" state changes.  At the time of this writing we do not know of any GCS that "
"makes use of this message."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BTN_REPORT_SEND<BTN_REPORT_SEND>` 设置每次按钮状态变化时，向地面站发送 `BUTTON_CHANGE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#BUTTON_CHANGE>`__ "
"MAVLink2消息的时长。截至撰写本文时，我们尚不知道有哪个GCS会使用此消息。"
